{"version":1,"content":"<p>清晨6時10分，警方接獲報案指深水埗富昌邨富盈樓一名男子在單位的房間上吊。</p><p>救護員接報到場，將陷入昏迷的33歲姓黃男子，送往明愛醫院搶救，其後不治。</p><p>警方經初步調查，相信事主受財務問題困擾，未有留下遺書，其死因有待驗屍後確定。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T04:38:39.761782+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T04:29:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T22:17:35.120063+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T04:37:34.254822+00:00","content_hash":"09f54ddaa6e9b5b67d8269649c66f74a40b451f919714dddcb7e9d736131669f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}